OL,3,GNEWSACalls to drop forest holiday park
OL,4,Aplan
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have urged Forestry England
OL,7,Fto drop plans for a holiday park, which
OL,8,Fhas faced hundreds of objections.
OL,10,FForestry England and Forest Holidays
OL,11,Fwant to build 70 cabins, a campsite,
OL,12,Fcafe, restaurant, shop and staff
OL,13,Faccommodation in Hamsterley Forest,
OL,14,FCounty Durham.
OL,16,FBut in an open letter Hamsterley Forest
OL,17,FAction Group (HFAG ) called on the
OL,18,Fagency to withdraw the planning
OL,19,Fapplication and "put the protection of
OL,20,Fpeople, wildlife, the environment and
OL,21,Fthe public purse first".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
