OL,3,GNEWSACalls to drop forest holiday park
OL,4,Aplan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Forestry England spokesperson said
OL,7,Ftheir focus remains on securing
OL,8,FHamsterley Forest's future, improving
OL,9,Fopportunities for visitors, supporting
OL,10,Flocal communities and delivering
OL,11,Fenvironmental, social and economic
OL,12,Fbenefits.
